{"id":"4005844729052919320","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"So it's two hours before the Olivia Rodrigo concert in Chicago, and StubHub has cancelled the tickets we purchased five months ago.\n\nI wonder if anyone and Congress can help? I have all the receipts, I have screenshots of every interaction today.\n\nThe automated customer service bot ended the chat on its own, and we are not able to reach anyone at their 866 phone number. \n\nPlease spread this far and wide to alert people to the scams this company is perpetrating. Thank you!￼￼\n\n#OliviaRodrigo","username":"samv007","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@samv007/post/DeXno6kkfYY","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:25:25Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:04.855162227Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_130efd03ec1e148d","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4005846984901025636","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"尋晚去咗呱呱睇軒軒演唱會🎶\n\n佢見我手上攞住一堆嘢好驚訝咁話「嘩，妳攞咁多嘢黎簽啊？」。\n\n跟著我就話「呢d嘢係送俾你㗎。」\n\n佢沈默咗一秒然後繼續話「你帶咁多嘢黎簽嘅？」\n\n呃😅我就知道佢真係好exhausted…\n\n簽名會排到我嘅時候，我同佢講份禮物係咩嘢以及注意事項，但佢係無咩反應，我需要重複兩三次佢先好似聽到並且答話。佢為咗大家開心，真係博曬命。佢已經將最後僅有嘅力氣係簽名會上貢獻埋俾大家。\n\n張敬軒多謝你，希望你尋晚簽完曬D嘢之後仲有力自己行返上車。\n\n亦都多謝所有臺前幕後照顧同幫助張軒嘅你哋。辛苦曬。我知道有好多fans好喉禽好狼死，又啪頭又摸中指咁😂我知道你哋辛苦所以我都好斯文㗎喇，叫軒軒直接俾只戒指我，不過佢唔蘇我之嘛。😂😂😂","username":"peggylin120","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@peggylin120/post/DeXoJvfmF9k","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:29:54Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-12T00:46:40.894199402Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_13f83d73ae972a6a","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4005883346982975431","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"✨送！10/12下午14:30遠東快閃店入場卷～\n昨天看完演唱會已趕回家當社畜\n歡迎今天下午有空的V.I.P私訊我，想用這張入場券免費送給去逛的朋友，希望能順便幫忙無償代購 2、3、12、17 這四樣周邊🤩\n萬事拜託有緣又善良的 VIP 了，歡迎私訊聊聊！✨","username":"r_i_n_a_t_w_","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@r_i_n_a_t_w_/post/DeXwa4UkrfH","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:42:09Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-12T00:46:40.894120634Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_e05417177c82bb59","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4005917112262405760","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"雖然ぬましょうさん的確是髭男的支援樂手，但今年台北場打擊樂器不是他。當時還小小扼腕了一下。\n\n他除了演奏很忙之外，行程應該也很忙。我手邊的演唱會BD，從髭男、Penthouse 、Omoinotake 、綠蘋果，一字排開取一個交集就是：台上都有ぬましょう🤤","username":"elrinrinrin","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@elrinrinrin/post/DeX4GOsDy6A","timestamp":"2026-10-11T23:49:14Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-12T00:46:40.894170869Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-12T00:47:10.930456Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_f761fcf9ff824aec","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
